a48932d9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d9712553/uploads/origins/33551a93-d7aa-45f4-b696-376897446214?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ed5ef6fc23f732725f04c4b70faaadc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d9712553/uploads/origins/33551a93-d7aa-45f4-b696-376897446214?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ed5ef6fc23f732725f04c4b70faaadc, https://si.imgix.net/d9712553/uploads/origins/33551a93-d7aa-45f4-b696-376897446214?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dca4f711d212875847ea31a64f5d664e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d9712553/uploads/origins/33551a93-d7aa-45f4-b696-376897446214?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1171b31297373e45e813fa572b7f274b 3x"}, "body": "I would love to request some cute art featuring Gaile and Kerplewy\u2019s Selene. Even though Selene always maintains her confident and arrogant appearance around the younger fox, she secretly likes Gaile like an older sister and wants her to become stronger. She also behaves almost like a strict mentor figure with a soft heart. Gaile has a lot of respect for Selene and is absolutely starstruck that the more experienced fox wants to spend time teaching her, which she is incredibly grateful for. Would you be fine with me requesting two images? For the first image, I would like to see the climax of a boxing match where Selene knocks Gaile out in Round 7 with a punch to the stomach that makes her spit out her blue mouthguard. In the second, Gaile and Selene eat dinner afterwards. Gaile's extremely excited about their intense fight while Selene struggles to hide her happiness at Gaile's growth. For the dinner scene, you are free to give Gaile simple clothes of your own choice. ^^\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CANdpmczGB2xngivklAR